committer alexeikarp <ak@hrbr.life> 1790248792 +0400

deployer, sandstorm: record as submodules at canonical main, replacing main's plain copies (monorepo consolidation A5)

main carried deployer/ (311 files, tree 62412cd8) and sandstorm/ (9,644
entries, tree 3f2d6663) as plain directories, last changed by the 05-21
crew and a few later edits; feat/greenfield-build records both as
submodules. This commit records them as submodules again. The pointers are
the current canonical main of each repository, not gfb's old pointers:

  deployer  -> melusina-os/melusina-os-deployer  9423bbd63476 (origin main)
  sandstorm -> melusina-os/melusina-os-sandstorm 37312a39b573 (origin main)

gfb's pointers (deployer 3c29aab3, sandstorm dd04994e) are ancestors of
these. .gitmodules gains the two entries in gfb's position; the file is now
byte-identical to gfb's (blob 4b1dfe41).

This removes main's unguarded copy of the retired FULL_REDEPLOY.sh (12,886
lines, no retirement guard). The canonical copy prints FATAL and exits 69
before doing anything.

Preservation: both removed trees are identical (tree ids) to those on
archive/20260924/monorepo-crew-legacy = dc691b2b (verified on origin), and
they remain in main's own history. Compared blob by blob against every
commit reachable from any ref of the canonical repositories (branches,
tags, pull refs), 49 files have no copy there, and each is on that archive
ref with the same blob:
  deployer (11): scripts/deploy-fineract-sidecar.sh and
    systemd/fineract-sidecar.service (05-21 crew fineract work, path never
    in canonical), FULL_REDEPLOY.sh, config/deployment.env{,.template},
    deploy-ui/static/index.html, deploy-ui/contract_test.go, and four
    incus-server-setup/scripts/solana-auth-service/ files.
  sandstorm (38): crew solana-tx-shim / index.js (87c83886) and
    hack-session.js requestChainSign (91176e79), web-session.capnp
    (4e87f724), README.md and CLAUDE.md (d88252e4), the TON wallet files,
    bundle/host.list, keys/release-{keyring.gpg,certificate.*.sig}, and
    older shell edits.

Makefile:70-77 resolve through an initialized submodule (checked on
clean exports): bash -n deployer/FULL_REDEPLOY.sh rc=0; py_compile of 62
deployer/scripts/*.py and node --check of 4 .cjs + 13 .mjs rc=0;
pytest tests/collisions/ 51 passed, 1 skipped (same as before).

A checkout of main that holds plain deployer/ or sandstorm/ directories
needs `git submodule update --init deployer sandstorm` after moving to
this commit, and must first move aside any untracked files git leaves in
those directories.

Analysis: agentchat scratchpad/msb-run/estate-bootstrap-evidence-20260920/
MONOREPO_LINE_DIVERGENCE_20260924.md section 4, step A5.

